 size` | The new row | `N-size-verify.log` (+ `run2`); reviewer R7 shape KILLED |\n35|| P3-h unknown+protected body unpinned either way | DECIDED: keep the refusal (only exactly-`ciphertext` protected bodies project opaque; anything else refuses rather than guessing which bytes are safe); pinned by `unknown_protected_plaintext_body` | The new row | `N-unknown-protected-body.log` (+ `run2`); reviewer R8 shape KILLED |\n36|| P3-i non-JSONL members refuse | Bound STATED (doc.go, TRACEABILITY.md, matrix §D) and pinned by `TestNormalizeNonJSONLIncludedMemberRefuses` (binary index + text cache subtests) | The new test | `pkg-cloneproject-v.log` |\n37|| P3-j 10.2 attributions dropped | Binding owns the UNION of the 8 landed trunk cases + 3 clone cases; `10.2#2` gains `localstore-immutable-blob-install` | Rederivation pins + `--section 10.2` admitted | `section-10.2.log` |\n38|| P3-k non-narrowing labels | `N-empty-projection` labelled single-member class, `N-overflow-truncate` labelled behaviour swap (harness docstring + notes + TRACEABILITY.md + matrix; `No row is an arm-delete` claims fixed) | n/a (labels) | Harness diff |\n39|| P3-c width edges | Bound STATED (doc.go, TRACEABILITY.md, matrix §D); `N-string-bound` note no longer claims representativeness | n/a (deferred per-edge rows; the shared `StringLength` gate is landed) | — |\n40|| P3-l null directives | Pinned by `TestNormalizeNullDirectivesDecodeAsEmpty` (null decodes as zero directives) | The new test | `pkg-cloneproject-v.log` |\n41|\n42|## Inherited advisories (predecessor TASK-260830-2g5be6 rev3): one decision per group\n43|\n44|| Group | Decision |\n45||---|---|\n46|| 1. P3-a independent archive-digest oracle | DEFERRED to a follow-up on `internal/clonesnap` (orchestrator-routed). Reason: capture-operation measurement internals, outside this projection-fidelity leaf; this leaf changes no clonesnap production or test behavior. |\n47|| 2. P3-b quiet-store row under RaceArchive+OperatorExplicit | DEFERRED, same