null` decodes as\n204|empty. Full table with owners in the matrix, section D. No `ax`\n205|command, `doctor` result, or runtime capability is claimed\n206|anywhere.\n207|\n208|## Handoff state\n209|\n210|Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree for the handoff\n211|snapshot. Checklist: all producer items verified true this run\n212|and checked (evidence above + attached). Attached:\n213|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_results.md` (this file),\n214|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md`,\n215|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (real gzip: 30\n216|command logs, 7 race-group logs, package logs, 2×65 per-plant\n217|logs, 2 battery logs, section-run logs, digest log,\n218|`MANIFEST.sha256`).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
