{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c861","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b42c-6247-7d31-b9d8-d87c5b1f64f4"},"sequence":651,"recorded_at":1780531400001297,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b42e-4c50-78a2-b72a-f694f92a9dbe"},"task_id":"01a0b42e-4c50-78a2-b72a-f694f92a9dbe","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b42e-4c50-78a2-b72a-f694f92a9dbe","chunk":"Read text file `.temp/TASK-260830-32ypr2/rev2-review/res/TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-32ypr2 Conformance Matrix (rev2) — test-unknown-encrypted-and-incomplete-events\n2|\n3|Authority: `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md`, Sections 7.8, 10.2, 13.14.1.\n4|Production entry for every row: `Normalize` (`internal/cloneproject/normalize.go:97`).\n5|Every proof builds an on-disk fixture provider store, runs the real\n6|`clonesnap.Capture` entry (`internal/clonesnap/capture.go`), then `Normalize`\n7|over the sealed manifests and installed blobs. No row drives hand-written\n8|Canonical Events or calls an unexported helper directly (verified: no test\n9|references `dispatchRecord`, `dispatchProtected`, `resolveToolCalls`,\n10|`deriveLiveSurface`, `foldInstructions`, `foldUsage`, `contentBlockForText`,\n11|`installOverflow`, `parseNativeLine`, `collectMembers`, `splitRecordLines`,\n12|`strictMembers`, `bodyUint53`, `decodeBodyObject`, `bodyString`, or\n13|`checkActorSelector`).\n14|\n15|## A. AC coverage: 38 of 38 rows driven and measured\n16|\n17|One row per behavior the brief's four invariants name plus the\n18|rework-mandated strict-framing, value-model, and gate rows. \"Narrowing\"\n19|names the harness row(s) in\n20|`internal/cloneproject/testdata