{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cf8b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b42c-6247-7d31-b9d8-d87c5b1f64f4"},"sequence":1568,"recorded_at":1780531400003131,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4"},"call_id":"call_01a0b4392c8f74299f94f087f3c1edf9","text":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-32-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -n \\\"cloneproject\\\\|low-authority history\\\" README.md | head -n 20\\necho \\\"=== LOGBOOK head ===\\\"\\nhead -n 60 LOGBOOK.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Locate README section and LOGBOOK head\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"2450:[`internal/cloneproject`](internal/cloneproject) implements the Section\\n2458:low-authority history that never changes the effective instruction\\n2467:[`internal/cloneproject/TRACEABILITY.md`](internal/cloneproject/TRACEABILITY.md)\\n2473:go test ./internal/cloneproject -count=1\\n2474:go test ./internal/cloneproject -count=1 -cover\\n2475:PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/cloneproject/testdata/mutant_harness.py\\n=== LOGBOOK head ===\\n# Flight Logbook\\n\\n> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\\n> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\\n\\n## 2026-09-18\\n\\n### TASK-260830-32ypr2 — projection fidelity over captured bytes (FINAL leaf, STORY-260830-1cyj0q)\\n\\n- DELIVERED: `internal/cloneproject` implements the Section 13.14.1 projection-fidelity closure — `Normalize` derives a Canonical Session + Canonical Events from a sealed Clone Capture Manifest, its sealed Clone Raw Object Manifest, and blob bytes fetched through the real store layout. Unknown native types and unknown-class members become raw-addressable `opaque_event` records (`unknown_native_event`