{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cfb9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b42c-6247-7d31-b9d8-d87c5b1f64f4"},"sequence":1591,"recorded_at":1780531400003177,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b439-41d4-7500-9598-05acc894cbc4"},"task_id":"01a0b439-41d4-7500-9598-05acc894cbc4","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b439-41d4-7500-9598-05acc894cbc4","chunk":"Read text file `README.md`.\n(2439 line(s) above)\n2440|result, and no runtime capability claim.\n2441|\n2442|```bash\n2443|go test ./internal/clonesnap -count=1\n2444|go test ./internal/clonesnap -count=1 -cover\n2445|PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/clonesnap/testdata/mutant_harness.py\n2446|```\n2447|\n2448|## Clone Projection Fidelity\n2449|\n2450|[`internal/cloneproject`](internal/cloneproject) implements the Section\n2451|13.14.1 projection-fidelity closure over captured bytes: it derives a\n2452|Canonical Session and Canonical Events from a sealed Clone Capture\n2453|Manifest, its sealed Clone Raw Object Manifest, and the installed\n2454|payload blobs. Unknown native records become raw-addressable\n2455|`opaque_event` records with `opaque` visibility and resolvable\n2456|byte-range references; foreign encrypted and signed reasoning becomes\n2457|byte-exact `opaque_reasoning`; foreign instructions stay\n2458|low-authority history that never changes the effective instruction\n2459|snapshot; historical tools stay inert with incomplete calls resolving\n2460|to aborted history and an always-empty live surface; source usage is\n2461|counted into the source ledger only; and message-like text over\n2462|64 KiB becomes a Blob Descriptor reference to an installed overflow\n2463|blob, never a truncation. Every event and the session seal through\n2464|the `clonebundle` builders and re-decode before return; the only\n2465|durable write is overflow installation through the `localstore`\n2466|no-replace discipline. The clause map in\n2467|[`internal/cloneproject/TRACEABILITY.md`](internal/cloneproject/TRACEABILITY.md)\n2468|maps every pinned clause to its production entry and test, with the\n2469|sibling-owned bounds stated. It adds no `ax` command, no `doctor`\n2470|result, and no runtime capability claim.\n2471|\n2472|```bash\n2473|go test ./internal/cloneproject -count=1\n2474|go test ./internal/cloneproject -count=1 -cover\n2475|PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/cloneproject/testdata/mutant_harness.py\n2476|```\n2477|\n2478|## Crash/Restart Outcome Gate\n2479|\n2480|[`internal/crashgate`](internal/crashgate) executes the Section 13.13\n2481|crash/restart outcome gate over the landed checkpoint and journal owners. Its\n2482|boundary registry enumerates all 94 crash boundaries of the pinned Section\n2483|13.13 table plus the `CR-CLONE` prose range, verified against the pinned text\n2484|by a derivation test rather than a hand-typed list; each boundary is\n2485|classified per direct/task-board path as reachable through `sessckpt` capture\n2486|or the `matjournal` recovery evaluator, or `NOT APPLICABLE` with the exact\n2487|owning flow named. Every reachable row injects a crash after the boundary's\n2488|durable write (and after every external effect that may have happened),\n2489|restarts clean, and proves exactly one of `safe_retry`, `explicit_rollback`,\n2490|or `recoverable_parked_state` with the full conformance record the gate\n2491|requires, including the rejection cases (two live authorities, unfenced\n2492|continuation, and every substitution shape) and the journal-observable\n2493|Section 13.12 failure rows. Two seams carry real `SIGKILL` evidence; nine\n2494|narrowing mutants (one token-preserving) prove the classification predicates\n2495|and every rejection rule. The conformance matrix in\n2496|[`internal/crashgate/TRACEABILITY.md`](internal/crashgate/TRACEABILITY.md)\n2497|maps every clause and boundary ID to its test row, owner, or stated bound.\n2498|It adds no `ax` command, no `doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim.\n2499|\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
