{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d095","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b42c-6247-7d31-b9d8-d87c5b1f64f4"},"sequence":1701,"recorded_at":1780531400003397,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0dc60d48-0449-4263-a4d2-db59edd40fb4"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b439-f8a0-76d0-99a3-064c5d5009fd"},"task_id":"01a0b439-f8a0-76d0-99a3-064c5d5009fd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b439-f8a0-76d0-99a3-064c5d5009fd","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 125-137\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 62 narrowing rows, 2 labelled\n-non-narrowing rows, and the harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED\n-control. Every narrowing weakens one gate to admit exactly one\n-member of the class it must reject, and every killer drives the\n-production `Normalize` entry over real captured bytes.\n-`N-native-type-token` and `N-protection-encrypted` are the\n-token-preserving attacks: the searched-for text still matches\n-while the decision changes, and the killers execute the\n-behavioral suite. `N-empty-projection` is labelled single-member\n-class and `N-overflow-truncate` is labelled behaviour swap; no\n-other row is an arm-delete, and no plant covers two sites. The\n-battery runs twice with one raw log per plant per run carrying\n-the subprocess exit.\n+`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 72 narrowing rows, 3 labelled\n+non-narrowing rows, and the harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED\n+control. Every narrowing weakens one gate to admit exactly one\n+member of the class it must reject, and every killer drives the\n+production `Normalize` entry over real captured bytes.\n+`N-native-type-token` and `N-protection-encrypted` are the\n+token-preserving attacks: the searched-for text still matches\n+while the decision changes, and the killers execute the\n+behavioral suite. The six `N-alias-*` rows restore the\n+case-folded read for exactly one envelope member each; every\n+other alias stays an unclaimed extra under the plant.\n+`N-empty-projection` is labelled single-member class,\n+`N-overflow-truncate` is labelled behaviour swap, and\n+`N-pending-aborted` is labelled add-arm (`Normalize` passes nil\n+live work orders, so the narrowed condition alone cannot pend\n+from the entry and the plant appends the call explicitly); no\n+other row is an arm-delete. The five `N-strict-*` rows patch the\n+shared `strictMembers` body used by both frame sites (one gate,\n+two call sites); every other plant patches one site. The battery\n+runs twice with one raw log per plant per run carrying the\n+subprocess exit.\n","final_result":true}}}
